  "body": "The [`/_matrix/client/r0/thirdparty/location/{protocol}`](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.0#get-matrix-client-r0-thirdparty-location-protocol) endpoint specifies a `searchFields` query parameter with type `string`, but the description mentions it's: \"one or more\". What is the actual format for this query parameter?\r\n\r\nThe same is also true for [`/_matrix/client/r0/thirdparty/user/{protocol}`](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.0#get-matrix-client-r0-thirdparty-user-protocol), the only difference being that the query parameter is called `fields...`. I found in [`api/openapi_extensions.md`](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/master/api/openapi_extensions.md) that it is supposed to mean \"one or more\", but no specification on the actual format.",
